vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"3db1R99-mdSvx3QwryJSNQ","review_id":"OVfFMEHm42JvDXnHMY4S1w","date":"2008-01-31T19:14:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9482294321060181,"text_excerpt":"I returned here late night on 4/18/08. It looked like a different staff than they have had for years--I heard they changed owners. Only other difference is I thought they used to be open 24 hrs and now they close at 2am--we just made it. Maybe they were tired cause we were at the very end of the day, as there wasn't the usual hoopla screaming back and forth at the grill, but the food is still amazing. This time I went big and got an omelet with everything in it and topped chili. YUM YUM give me some. Also tried a bit of the burger which just melt in my mouth. The original review below is still accurate as well. :-) ____Original Review___ My favorite diner in the country hands down. What's..."},{"business_id":"3db1R99-mdSvx3QwryJSNQ","review_id":"BDtcLE_Rn8jugcYhYHQv5g","date":"2010-09-06T03:31:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.941065788269043,"text_excerpt":"I love this place. I live down the street so I have to ration myself on how often I go because otherwise I would be there all the time. The food is delicious and cheap. I always get a chef's omelet with the chili and fries. I have never finished the whole thing in one go, but I always feel satisfied. I took some visitors there the past weekend and they both loved it too. One of them kept asking when we could come back (and she was only here for three days). Chocolate pecan pie is great. Cheeseburgers are classic. Service is fun and fast. It's one of my favorite experiences in New Orleans."},{"business_id":"3db1R99-mdSvx3QwryJSNQ","review_id":"bP6_WEBmpTAWKmD1JCkeog","date":"2019-04-04T16:07:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9364541172981262,"text_excerpt":"I love this place. It was a first breakfast spot for me years ago during my very first visit to NOLA in 2008. Took my sister during her visit recently. The staff is also so charming. It's inexpensive and you get a ton of food! I try something different each time I go and I have never been disappointed! My daughter loves their onion and potato omelet. This last visit I was talked into the chili cheese omelet by a regular. It was huge! So good. They also have great coffee!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"3db1R99-mdSvx3QwryJSNQ","photo_id":"Hdcd_6-JsApJH2y-fm6oQA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/Hdcd_6-JsApJH2y-fm6oQA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8545020818710327},{"business_id":"3db1R99-mdSvx3QwryJSNQ","photo_id":"9L8rW5Lm5qOo5TPv8KUoFg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/9L8rW5Lm5qOo5TPv8KUoFg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8400146961212158},{"business_id":"3db1R99-mdSvx3QwryJSNQ","photo_id":"hjmfgBllynglq5DTYZGvug","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/hjmfgBllynglq5DTYZGvug.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8318207263946533},{"business_id":"3db1R99-mdSvx3QwryJSNQ","photo_id":"rr0XIYQkeKYT_OmtYTyuHA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/rr0XIYQkeKYT_OmtYTyuHA.jpg","v